#: ../../openmvcam/shields/can-rs232-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/can-rs232-shield.rst:6
msgid "CAN/RS232 Shield"
msgstr "CAN/RS232 Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/can-rs232-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The CAN/RS232 Shield combines a CAN-FD transceiver with an RS-232 "
"transceiver so the OpenMV Cam can talk to vehicles, controllers, and legacy "
"serial gear from a single shield, with wide-input power and reverse-voltage "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"CAN/RS232 Shield menggabungkan transceiver CAN-FD dengan transceiver RS-232 "
"sehingga OpenMV Cam dapat berkomunikasi dengan kendaraan, kontroler, dan "
"perangkat serial lama dari satu shield, dengan daya input wide dan proteksi "
"tegangan balik."

